#!/usr/bin/env etcs
#IMPORT ACE_ROOT/modules

# ── HOST A SESSION ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# A TEMPLATE for any game that claims Trace and Present (ontology/Trace.h,
# Present.h): the page fills in {{n}} (this session's number, keeping its
# names its own), {{name}} (this runtime's name in it), {{id}} (its id, what
# the link carries) and {{hub}} (the site's LinkHub), and runs it with `game`
# and `hall` handed in -- the hall being the site's name server as this
# runtime sees it, where the game lists itself under its own kind for as long
# as this link lasts.
#
# THE GAME IS THE AUTHORITY, and what the room publishes of it is all a guest
# can reach: its trace to mirror, and a seat to take its lines. Nothing else
# is spawned -- a guest's stream is its seat, and the order the game reads the
# seats in is the order.

spawn NetworkProvider::Room room{{n}}
room{{n}}.SetName({{name}})
room{{n}}.Publish(game @game Trace Take)

requires game [Trace]
requires hall [Lobby]
game.Host({{name}} @hall {{id}})

room{{n}}.HostVia({{hub}}/{{id}})
